  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#82] [Feature] Fix FeederMessageDeserializer — throws ArgumentOutOfRangeException for Protobuf/MessagePack/Xml/Yaml; wire IFormatDeserializerRegistry   FeederMessageDeserializer.cs:   - Added IFormatSerializerRegistry _registry field + constructor parameter   - Changed the _ fallback in both Deserialize(string) and Deserialize(byte[]) from throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException() to   _registry.GetDeserializer(_feederConfiguration.SerializerType).Deserialize<TFeederMessage>(data/bytes) — this covers Protobuf, MessagePack, Xml, Yaml transparently   - DeserializeInto methods are unchanged (they call Deserialize in the default path, which now works for all formats)",
